crueles vituperios. ", "chapterCount": 40, "labels": ["Justice Served", "Modern"], "tags": ["Justice Served", "Modern"], "typeTwoIds": [308], "typeTwoNames": ["Identidad Secreta"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 308, "name": "Identidad Secreta", "replaceName": "identidad-secreta"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Identidad-Secreta", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "¡Lárgate-de-mi-Bugatti", "bookNameLower": "¡lárgate-de-mi-bugatti", "shelfTime": "2026-09-28 00:00:00", "firstShelfTime": "2026-09-28 00:00:00", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000023794", "bookName": "El despertar del archimago supremo", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023794/42000023794.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 59906, "introduction": "Tras salvar el mundo, Arturo Torres, el archimago supremo, queda sin alma. La princesa Elisa Valera lo rescata y lo cuida durante años, aunque él vive con la mente perdida. Cuando nobles arrogantes obligan a su fiel esposa a aceptar un matrimonio humillante, Arturo despierta y recupera su poder divino. Entonces convoca a sus discípulos —la Reina Dragón, el Gran Mago y el emperador— para destruir a sus enemigos y poner el mundo a los pies de Elisa.", "chapterCount": 55, "labels": ["Playing Dumb", "The Chosen One"], "tags": ["Playing Dumb", "The Chosen One"], "typeTwoIds": [308], "typeTwoNames": ["Identidad Secreta"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 308, "name": "Identidad Secreta", "replaceName": "identidad-secreta"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Identidad-Secreta", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "El-despertar-del-archimago-supremo", "bookNameLower": "el-despertar-del-archimago-supremo", "shelfTime": "2026-08-07 10:00:03", "firstShelfTime": "2026-08-07 10:00:03", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000032632", "bookName": "La hija del padrino no se toca", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000032632/42000032632.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 8759, "in